# IB Job Skill Mapping System - Team Data Ingestion Cron
#
# Scheduled execution: 2:00 AM IST (8:30 PM UTC previous day)
#
# IST is UTC+5:30, so:
# 2:00 AM IST = 8:30 PM UTC (previous day)
# 
# Cron format: minute hour day month weekday user command
#
# Minute: 30 (8:30 PM)
# Hour: 20 (8 PM in 24-hour format)
# Day: * (every day)
# Month: * (every month)
# Weekday: * (every day of week)
# User: app (application service account)
# Command: /opt/ib-job-skill-mapping-system/scripts/run_ingestion.sh
#
# The script will:
# - Load environment variables
# - Execute Python ingestion module
# - Log to /var/log/ib-job-skill-ingestion/
# - Send email on failure (if MAILTO is set)

# Run daily at 2:00 AM IST (8:30 PM UTC)
30 20 * * * app /opt/ib-job-skill-mapping-system/scripts/run_ingestion.sh

# Optional: Retry failed batches at 3:00 AM IST (9:30 PM UTC)
# Uncomment the line below to enable automatic retry of failed batches
# 30 21 * * * app /opt/ib-job-skill-mapping-system/scripts/run_ingestion.sh --retry-failed
